  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/blob/1.18.2/md/banner.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/raw/1.18.2/md/banner.png\" alt=\"Automobility\"></a></p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility#a-minecraft-mod-adding-customizable-vehicles\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><strong>一个添加可定制车辆的 Minecraft 模组。</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Automobility 目前处于 BETA 测试阶段！</strong><br>该模组尚未完善所有功能，非常欢迎提出功能建议。可在模组的 GitHub Discussions 页面或<span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/7Aw3y4RtY9\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span>中讨论。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility#available-for-fabricquilt\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>适用于 <strong>Fabric/Quilt</strong> 和 <strong>Forge</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>需要&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></strong></span>&nbsp;(Fabric) 或<span style=\"color:#f60\">&nbsp;<strong><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fqsl\" rel=\"nofollow\">QSL</a></strong></span>&nbsp;(Quilt)</li>\n<li>Forge 版本无需额外模组</li>\n<li>请点击页面顶部的 <strong>文件</strong> 以查看所有加载器对应的版本</li>\n</ul>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#008000\">目前维护的版本为 1.20/1.20.1，</span>&nbsp;旧版本已停止维护</strong></span></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility#getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><strong>入门指南</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>配方：</strong>&nbsp;可使用<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>EMI</strong></a></span>&nbsp;(Fabric/Quilt) 或<span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>JEI</strong></a>&nbsp;</span>(Forge) 查看合成配方。</li>\n<li><strong>汽车零部件：</strong>&nbsp;制作一台自动机械师工作台。使用界面制作汽车的车架、引擎和车轮。你还可以选择制作附加组件。</li>\n<li><strong>组装汽车：</strong>&nbsp;制作一台汽车装配台以及一把撬棍。将零件放置在装配台上，直到车辆组装完成。使用撬棍即可拆解车辆。</li>\n<li><strong>升级汽车：</strong>&nbsp;使用自动机械师工作台制作附加组件，将其安装到汽车上可为其增添实用功能或增强性能。</li>\n<li><strong>道路建设：</strong>&nbsp;你可以使用斜坡、加速板、越野地砖等方块来建造公路、赛道或障碍场地。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/blob/1.18.2/md/construction.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/raw/1.18.2/md/construction.png\" alt=\"汽车建造\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/blob/1.18.2/md/parking.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/raw/1.18.2/md/parking.png\" alt=\"汽车类型\"></a></p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility#driving\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><strong>驾驶</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>W - 加速</li>\n<li>S - 刹车/倒车/烧胎</li>\n<li>A/D - 左转/右转</li>\n<li>空格键 - 漂移</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>手柄支持：</strong>&nbsp;当使用<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightcontrols\" rel=\"nofollow\">MidnightControls</a></span> 时，你将可以通过以下默认按键控制汽车：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A - 加速</li>\n<li>B - 刹车/倒车</li>\n<li>左摇杆 - 转向</li>\n<li>右扳机键 - 漂移</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/blob/1.18.2/md/driving.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/raw/1.18.2/md/driving.png\" alt=\"驾驶\"></a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
